1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,460
The weather forecast has been really off lately.

2
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:22,200
So much for only a 10% chance of rain.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,860
Hey, are you okay?

4
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,280
Oh, good. You're not hurt?

5
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,500
That's not that much.

6
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,640
Please, don't come any closer to me.

7
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,900
Don't hurt me.

8
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,860
Please, please don't hurt me.

9
00:00:50,860 --> 00:01:03,500
The rain comes from an unknown world, washing the Earth with its tears.

10
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:09,620
Is this new meeting a temporary necessity, or is it more likely to be a contrived coincidence?

11
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:14,800
Because, as we all know, there is more than one truth.

12
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:50,840
Don't hurt me.

13
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,320
Don't hurt me.

14
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:56,040
Don't hurt me.

15
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:15,560
, don't hurt me.

16
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:22,560
I choose to choose

17
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:41,560
Shino! I made these things called cookies!

18
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:43,560
We were supposed to make them during cooking class

19
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,560
and the other students taught me how!

20
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,560
So do you want to try one?

21
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,560
Sure. I'd love to. Thanks.

22
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:56,560
Hey, Tobichi.

23
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,560
No way! You get out!

24
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:01,560
Be careful, Shino! That witch is going to do more damage!

25
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,560
I'm so sorry.

26
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:06,560
Although I know an apology is hardly enough.

27
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:09,560
Why is this super genius apologizing to him?

28
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,560
What are we missing?

29
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,560
Maybe he's got some dirt on her.

30
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,560
That's so lame.

31
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,560
Oh, it's fine. You can stop bowing now.

32
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,560
Just don't worry about it, okay?

33
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,560
Listen up. No more cheating, okay?

34
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,560
Get your sticky hands off him!

35
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:27,560
The report said that you stayed.

36
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,560
Tell me what you're still doing here.

37
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,560
That's none of your business!

38
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,560
Now focus, Shino.

39
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,560
Forget about the stupid ugly witch and eat my cookies.

40
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,560
And mine.

41
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,560
I baked cookies too.

42
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,560
You need to stop copying me!

43
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:43,560
Actually, I baked mine first, so you're copying me.

44
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,560
Wrong!

45
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,560
And besides, look at your dumb cookies.

46
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,560
I bet they suck.

47
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,560
Come on.

48
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,560
Yeah, they're not all that great, so...

49
00:03:57,560 --> 00:04:01,560
Here, eat! Quick before she tries to make you eat her junk!

50
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,560
No, you should try mine first.

51
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,560
Yum!

52
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,560
They're both good.

53
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,560
Mine must be better. He ate it much faster.

54
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:15,560
Incorrect. He ate mine .2 seconds faster than yours.

55
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,560
Excuse me?

56
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,560
Hey!

57
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:21,560
Some strange little stranger just gave me a whole bag of cookies.

58
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,560
Do you want one, Cheeto?

59
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,560
I'd let her, but she's watching her figure.

60
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:33,560
Man, it wasn't supposed to rain today, either.

61
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,560
Hmm.

62
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:48,560
Hey, Kotari, I made it home.

63
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,560
I'm gonna go take a shower.

64
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,560
Get out of here right now!

65
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,560
Kotari, what's going on?

66
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,560
Why is Toka here?

67
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,560
Hey!

68
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,560
Welcome back home, bro.

69
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,560
Oh, thanks.

70
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,560
Don't change the subject.

71
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:17,560
Now please tell me what Toka's doing in our house.

72
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:20,560
Well, I've decided she should live with us, you know, at least for the time being.

73
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,560
Okay, do you mind telling me why that is?

74
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:26,560
We have a good reason for this. Chill.

75
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,560
Reina?

76
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,560
What are you doing here?

77
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,560
Oh, sorry.

78
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,560
Am I using too much sugar again?

79
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,560
No.

80
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,560
Well, yes, but I don't really care about that.

81
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,560
Toka's aftercare.

82
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:40,560
That's right.

83
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:45,560
Fortunately, when she kissed you, her spirit power was immediately and effectively sealed.

84
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:48,560
And now, there is an invisible road.

85
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:51,560
What we call a path between the two of you.

86
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:54,560
Okay, but what's this thing about a seal?

87
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:57,560
I explained that to you after it happened.

88
00:05:57,560 --> 00:06:03,560
When you kissed Toka after raising her mood points, you in particular were able to absorb her spirit powers and seal them.

89
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:06,560
So why is it I have that kind of power?

90
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,560
I'm not sure.

91
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:11,560
I just got lucky and figured it out.

92
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,560
With Ratataskar's help.

93
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,560
Can I continue with my point?

94
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:27,560
Now, if the spirit's mental condition becomes unstable, there is a significant probability that the power seals inside you will return back to her.

95
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,560
Huh?

96
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:33,560
Our research is conclusive. Toka's numbers are the most stable when she is near you.

97
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:39,560
Until the special housing unit for spirits is completed, it would be best for everyone if she stays here.

98
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:41,560
Right. Whatever.

99
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:44,560
This isn't a bad thing. Consider it a part of your training.

100
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:50,560
You mean I wasn't finished? Toka's powers are already sealed. What else am I supposed to do?

101
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:55,560
Did I say Toka was the only spirit around? There are more out there.

102
00:06:55,560 --> 00:07:01,560
A lot more, in fact. Special designation disaster beings, also known as spirits.

103
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,560
They come in all shapes and sizes just like us.

104
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:08,560
We want you to continue speaking with them, Shin.

105
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:11,560
We need you to become even better at dealing with women.

106
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:14,560
The world needs you to become even better at dealing with women.

107
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:19,560
Great. No pressure at all. But I still don't get why I have to live with Toka.

108
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:29,560
I... I apologize, Shido. I knew it. I shouldn't be here.

109
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:32,560
No. You're fine. I'm a jerk.

110
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,560
This weird is never gonna end.

111
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:39,560
Shido! The light's out in the bathroom! Go change it immediately!

112
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:42,560
Of course. Fine. I'm on it.

113
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:46,560
Why does she have to be so mean when she's in her commander mode?

114
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:50,560
I'm normally the one to do this stuff, but still.

115
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,560
Sorry. I'm so sorry. I should have knocked.

116
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,560
Oh my god, you creep!

117
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:02,560
Someone was in a rush. Shame on Shido.

118
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,560
You did that on purpose.

119
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,560
I told you this was training, didn't I?

120
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:09,560
You need to learn how to face any situation calm and collected.

121
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:13,560
Toka! I'm sorry. I didn't know you were in there.

122
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,560
It's fine. I forgive you.

123
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:19,560
Just... hand that to me, please.

124
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:25,560
Shido, I got a bath all ready for you. You can go ahead and wash up.

125
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,560
Nah, I'm good. You go instead.

126
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:33,560
Oh, and here. You can use these if you want.

127
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:37,560
Kotari has never given up first dibs when I've got these.

128
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:40,560
She should know not to underestimate me.

129
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:45,560
I, Shidoitsuka, haven't grown up in the same house as you without learning a thing or two.

130
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,560
That's so nice.

131
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,560
But, uh, why don't you go ahead and use them?

132
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:53,560
I think so.

133
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:57,560
Hey, Toka. You're not taking a bath right now?

134
00:08:57,560 --> 00:09:00,560
No. I'm standing in this door.

135
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:03,560
Maybe I was being too suspicious.

136
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:09,560
Go figure, there are spirits besides Toka.

137
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,560
I wonder how many there are.

138
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,560
And will I be able to save them all?

139
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,560
Kotari, I'm gonna kill you!

140
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:20,560
Not my fault, you're dumb.

141
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,560
Oh, crap!

142
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,560
Charge!

143
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,560
Hm?

144
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,560
Whoa!

145
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,560
Um, hi.

146
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:43,560
You can't just bump out at me like that, you know?

147
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:47,560
And another fail.

148
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:50,560
This is supposed to be my training.

149
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,560
Shido!

150
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,560
It's time for lunch!

151
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,560
Why are you here, witch?

152
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:01,560
You're not welcome.

153
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,560
I was going to say the same thing.

154
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,560
Can't we all just eat together?

155
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,560
What?

156
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,560
What is it?

157
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,560
Share all you want, I'm not sharing.

158
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:20,560
Excuse me, what is that?

159
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:24,560
Uh, the thing is, this morning we bought our bentos from the same place.

160
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,560
I bumped into Toka while she was there.

161
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,560
Liar!

162
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:33,560
You bought this 154 days ago at the discount store in front of the station for $15.80.

163
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:36,560
You've been using the same container ever since.

164
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,560
This is not from the bento shop.

165
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,560
And how exactly do you know this?

166
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,560
That's not really important.

167
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,560
Ugh!

168
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,560
Don't leave me out of the conversation like that, it's rude!

169
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,560
Now what are you two talking about?

170
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,560
Hey!

171
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:52,560
Cheeto!

172
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,560
My girlfriend wants me to help her pick out clothes.

173
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,560
Do you think a French maid is best?

174
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,560
Shrine maiden? Nurse?

175
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,560
Maybe stripper?

176
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,560
Dude, this is not the best time!

177
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,560
Who cares if she's a maid or whatever else?

178
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:01,560
Maid it is!

179
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,560
Thanks, man!

180
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,560
Your attention, please.

181
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,560
This is not a drill.

182
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:13,560
There have been precursory signs of an imminent spatial quake in this vicinity.

183
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:15,560
We evacuate to the nearest shelter immediately.

184
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,560
I repeat, there have been precursory signs of an imminent spatial...

185
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:20,560
Kids! Another quake alarm!

186
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:22,560
We have to evacuate immediately!

187
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,560
Move it or lose it, as they say!

188
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:26,560
Lee?

189
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,560
Yeah.

190
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,560
You want me to leave her behind?

191
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,560
Yes.

192
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:35,560
Remember, her powers have been sealed, so she's the same as a normal human being.

193
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:38,560
Besides, we can't afford for her stress levels to go up.

194
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:40,560
Watching a fight might trigger that.

195
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,560
That's true.

196
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,560
Shito! Toka! Miss Murasame!

197
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,560
Why are you dawdling back there?

198
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:48,560
If you don't hurry up and evacuate, you're gonna be in serious trouble and serious danger!

199
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:51,560
Miss Okamine, will you watch Toka for me?

200
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:53,560
What? Of course!

201
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:55,560
I'll keep an eye on her.

202
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,560
Shito...

203
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,560
Hey, Toka.

204
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,560
I need to leave you here, okay?

205
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:00,560
Something just came up.

206
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,560
I have to go, but I'll be right back.

207
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,560
Now? It's dangerous.

208
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,560
I'll be fine, I promise!

209
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,560
Shito Itaka, come back here!

210
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,560
You too, Miss Murasame!

211
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:09,560
Where do you think you're going?

212
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,560
Oh, Shito...

213
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,560
Hey, you made it.

214
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:17,560
Well, for the aftermath anyway.

215
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,560
It's smaller than usual this time.

216
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:25,560
I'd like to say this was a good sign, but this is about average for a hermit.

217
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:27,560
Hermit?

218
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,560
The name of the spirit that's appeared this time.

219
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:32,560
She's known for being more docile than the other spirits we've seen.

220
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,560
Hold on. I've seen this girl before.

221
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,560
Where and when?

222
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,560
I met her at the shrine. Two nights ago.

223
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:47,560
We were already tracking her by then, but we saw no disruption of her main spirit wave numbers at that time.

224
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,560
So, it's the same as it was for Toka.

225
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:53,560
The AST has arrived. They are commencing their attack.

226
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:07,560
How can they fire on a little girl?

227
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,560
What she looks like doesn't matter to the AST.

228
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:12,560
She's trying to run away. What they're doing is wrong.

229
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,560
Don't feel sorry for her, Shito.

230
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:16,560
That behavior will only make you weak.

231
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:19,560
Kotari!

232
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:21,560
Let's do it.

233
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:23,560
I want to go save that girl.

234
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:26,560
There you go. That's so my big brother for you.

235
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,560
Listen up! Prepare for a Type 1 capture!

236
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,560
Right!

237
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:33,560
Okay. I think it's about time we go on another date.

238
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,560
Hermit has entered the building.

239
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:40,560
AST, I want you to hold your positions until the target is moved.

240
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,560
So, you think Hermit is really going to come here?

241
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:46,560
Yes. Based on the analysis, there's no doubt.

242
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:50,560
The AST probably won't be able to make a move for a while.

243
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:57,560
Don't tell me you're here to bully Yoshinan too!

244
00:13:57,560 --> 00:14:08,560
Oh? The Lucky Letcher has returned for more, hasn't he?

245
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,560
Shito, hold on a sec.

246
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:30,560
Talk to me, people. Name your choice.

247
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,560
Come on! It's gotta be two!

248
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:36,560
This one's straight out of a dating sim. Go with two!

249
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,560
Isn't that risky if you don't know the other person's personality?

250
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,560
Seems one is our best bet.

251
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,560
Hermit rarely attacks humans.

252
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:46,560
I'm gonna have to go with option three.

253
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,560
Shito, go with three!

254
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:50,560
Uh, are you sure about that?

255
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,560
Come on. Don't you know someone who would talk like that?

256
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:54,560
Tonomachi.

257
00:14:57,560 --> 00:15:01,560
Excuse me. I don't know what you mean. I'm just a wandering vagabond.

258
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:10,560
You're trying to make me laugh, aren't you? Nobody talks like that seriously.

259
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:13,560
Well, I'm glad you liked my joke.

260
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:16,560
So, my name's Shito. You are?

261
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:22,560
